{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "1", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Περὶ γέροντος νὰ μὴν πάρῃ κορίτσι"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "2", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "άγνωστος"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "3", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ΠΕΡΙ ΓΕΡΟΝΤΟΣ ΝΑ ΜΗΝ ΠΑΡΗΙ ΚΟΡΙΤΣΙ."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "4", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἄρχοντες πλούσιοι καὶ πτωχοὶ, πατέρες καὶ μητέρες,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "5", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ συγγενεῖς ὁπὤχετε ὕπανδραις θυγατέρες,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "6", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "περιττοπλεὸν ᾑ κορασιαῖς ποῦ θὲ νὰ ʼπανδρευτῆτε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "7", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "γροικήσετε τὰ λόγια μου καὶ κάμε νὰ φρονῆτε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "8", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ἐσεῖς τὰ μέλλοντα τοῦ κόσμου τὰ δέν πράξῃ 5"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "9", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "οὐδὲν ἠξεύρω νὰ τὸ ʼπῇ οὐδʼ ἄλλην νά διατάξῃ·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "10", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μόνον ἐγὼ ὁ πολυπαθὴς ὁποῦ ἤκουσα καὶ ξεύρω"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "11", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐσᾶς ὁποῦ εἶσθεν ἄμαθοι, θέλω τα νὰ τὰ φέρω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "12", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μάλιστα ὁποῦ ἔμαθα ἀπό τοὺς ποιητάδες"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "13", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁποῦ ἔπραξαν ἀπὸ καιρὸν τοῦ κόσμου ταῖς γλυκάδες. 10"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "14", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπὸν παρακαλῶ σάς το, καλογροικήσετέ το,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "15", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ἂν ἔναι ʼμπορεσάμενον, ἐκ στήθου μάθετέ το,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "16", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐτοῦτο τὸ ἐξήγημα ὁποῦ ἔγραψα σε ῥῆμα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "17", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ἂν ἐν καὶ λέγω ψέματα, ὅλοι μὲ ʼπέτε κτῆμα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "18", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰπέτε με „ἀνάθεμα ἐσένα, τʼ ὄνομά σου, 15"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "19", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐσένα καὶ τὴν τέχνην σου καὶ μὲ τὸ μάθημά σου.“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "20", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ὅποια τῆς φαίνεται κακὸ, ἂς βήξῃ νὰ γροικήσω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "21", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κʼ ἐγὼ διὰ τὴν ἀγάπην της πλέον νὰ μὴν ʼμιλήσω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "22", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπὸν, ἄρχοντες, νὰ τὸ ʼπῶ, κι ὅποια θέλει ἂς χολιάσῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "23", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ὅποια μὲ ʼβρίζει μέσα της, Χριστὲ, νὰ μὴν χρονιάσῃ. 20"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "24", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅποια ζηλέψῃ σὲ φλουριὰ, σὲ ῥοῦχα, σὲ λογάρι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "25", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ γέρον νὰ καταδεκτῇ, ἄνδρα νὰ τὸν ἐπάρῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "26", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τὴν ἰδῶ, νὰ δέρνεται μὲ δυὸ μαῦρα λιθάρια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "27", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ τὴν κάψῃ κʼ ἡ φωτιὰ, τοῦ ἅι Ἀντωνιοῦ ἡ λάβρα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "28", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰ τύχῃ μάνα κι ἀγαπᾷ ἢ συγγενὴν καὶ κύριν, 25"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "29", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τοὺς ἰδῶ νὰ κολυμποῦν σὲ βοῦρκα σὰν οἱ χοῖροι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "30", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διατί λιμπίζονται εἰς φλουρὶν, σὲ πλοῦτος κʼ εἰς ἀμπέλια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "31", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ συμπωλοῦν τοῦ γέροντος ταῖς γλύκαις καὶ τὰ μέλια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "32", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν νεότην καὶ ταῖς ἐμμορφιαῖς, τὰ δροσερὰ τὰ κάλλη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "33", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐπούλησαν τοῦ γέροντος διὰ τὰ φλωριά του πάλι. 30"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "34", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διὰ τὸ πολὺν τʼ ἀντίπροικο καὶ ῥοῦχα ὁποῦ δίδει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "35", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "παίρνει τὴν νεὰν ὁ γέροντας καὶ τρῷ την σὰν ἀπίδι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "36", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐκεῖνον τὸ γλυκώτατον τʼ ἄνθος τῆς παρθενίας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "37", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν γλύκαν τῆς γλυκότητος, τῆς ἐρωτοκρατίας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "38", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τοῦ δενδροῦ τʼ ὀπωρικὸ τʼ ἀνάθρεφεν ἡ κόρη 35"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "39", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὲ προσοχὴ καὶ μὲ τιμὴ, κι ἀνάθρεφʼ ὅσον ʼμπόρει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "40", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ηὗρεν ὁ γέρος ὥριμον τʼ ἀπίδι καὶ δροσίστη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "41", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὸ κλαδάκιν τοῦ δενδροῦ ἀπὸ τὸν τόπον σχίσθη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "42", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ στάξασιν τὰ φύλλα του δρόσον ὁποῦ ἐγέμαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "43", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁμάδι μὲ τῆς παρθενιᾶς τὸ τιμημένον αἷμαν. 40"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "44", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ στέκω καὶ θαυμάζομαι τὸ θαύμασμα τὸ μέγα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "45", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πῶς ἐδυνήθη κʼ ἔκοψεν ἡ μαραμένη βέργα"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "46", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τῆς παρθενιᾶς τὴν δύναμιν καὶ τὴν ἐνοστιμάδα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "47", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τῆς ἐρωτιᾶς τὴν δύναμιν πὤγεμε τὴν γλυκάδα."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "48", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ἀπήτις ἔφα μισὴ φορὰ τὸ ζαχαράτο μέλι, 45"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "49", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀπὸ τὸν κόπον τὸν πολὺν ἔμεινε σὰν γυψέλη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "50", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ πλεὸν οὐδὲν δυνήθηκεν τὸ μέλι νὰ τὸ στύψῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "51", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ἔπεσάν του τὰ νεφρὰ καὶ δὲν ʼμπορεῖ νὰ σκύψῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "52", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀτόνησε καὶ δὲν μπορεῖ τάχα ὡσὰν νὰ σκάπτῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "53", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀγκομαχεῖ συχνὰ συχνὰ, καὶ ἡ καρδιά του ἅφτει. 50"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "54", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ῥωχαλίζει ὡς ἀγριόχοιρος καὶ βρυχημὸν καὶ ῥόχη"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "55", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀγκομαχεῖ ὁ κακότυχος σὰν νὰ ʼτρεχε σʼ ἐγδόχη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "56", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀγριόνει καὶ τὰ μάτια του σὰν ψοφισμένου σκύλου,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "57", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀφρίζει καὶ τὸ στόμα του ὡσὰν λυσσιάρη σκύλου,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "58", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀνατριχοῦν τὰ γένεια του καὶ τρίζουν σὰν * χηναίου. 55"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "59", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὰ ʼδόντια του ἐκ τὰ γερατιὰ δὲν ἔχουν τί σοῦ λέγουν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "60", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ δὲν τὸ γνώθει ὁποῦ γροικᾷ τοῦ γέροντα κανάκια"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "61", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πῶς εἶναι πούπετις πικρὰ πλεὸν παρὰ φαρμάκια."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "62", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ πῶς νὰ σᾶς διηγηθῶ εἰς τʼ ἀγκαλιάσματά του;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "63", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἄνοστα καὶ κακόχνωτα εἶνʼ τʼ ἀγκαλιάσματά του; 60"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "64", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὰ παιγνίδια του ψοφοῦν σὰν νύκτα μαυρισμένη."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "65", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ποιά ʼναι κείνη ποῦ ʼμπορεῖ νὰ βλέπῃ, νὰ ʼπομένῃ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "66", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁληνυκτὶς ποῦ δὲν ψηφᾷ, μόνον ποῦ ῥωχαλιάζει;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "67", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κʼ ἡ κόρη σήτα τὸν γροικᾷ, πλήσκει καὶ τικτικιάζει·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "68", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὸ ταχὺ σηκόνεται, λέγει της „ἄμε, ʼντύσου, 65"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "69", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "βάλε τὰ ροῦχα τἄμορφα, ἀγάπη μου, στολίσου.“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "70", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὸ λοιπὸν στολίζεται τὸ ταπεινὸ τρυγόνι"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "71", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τʼ ἀντίπροικο τοῦ γέροντος καὶ δείχνει σὰν παγώνι·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "72", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κι ὡσὰν ἰδῇ τὸν ἄνδρα της, πλήσκει και καλοντόνει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "73", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κʼ εἰς μιὸν ταχὺ μετανογᾷ ὡσὰν τʼ ὀξὺ λιμόνι. 70"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "74", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "γροικᾷς καὶ λέγει μέσα της, „κακὸ ῥιζικὸ ὁποῦ ʼχα!"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "75", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τί τὄθελα τʼ ἀντίπροικο καὶ τὰ πολλὰ τὰ ῥοῦχα;“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "76", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἴ τε κι ἂν ἔναι φρόνιμη, μὲ τοῦ καιροῦ τὸ θάῤῥος"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "77", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ λέγει πάντα μέσα της „μήνα τὸν πάρῃ ὁ Χάρος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "78", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τότε μὲ τὰ ῥοῦχά του καὶ μὲ τὰ ἐδικά μου 75"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "79", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ πάρω ἕναν νειούτσικον εἰς τὸ πλευρὸν κοντά μου.“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "80", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "παρηγορᾶται ἡ ἄτυχος μὲ τοῦτα καὶ μʼ ἐκεῖνα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "81", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼς τὸν Χάρον ἔχει θαῤῥετά, ʼς τὸ φθιάρι, ʼς τὴν ἀξίνα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "82", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νύκτα ʼμέρα καρτερεῖ, ʼς τὸν Χάρον ἔχει ὀλπίδα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "83", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μήνα τὸν κόψῃ ξαφνικά ἡ λοιμικὴ ψιλίδα. 80"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "84", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπὸν ἂν λέγω ψέματα ἤ γράφω παραμύθια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "85", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼρωτᾶτέ ταις ὁποῦ ἔπαθαν νὰ ʼποῦσιν τὴν ἀλήθειαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "86", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ πῶς νὰ σοῦ ʼξηγοῦμαι ʼγὼ τοῦ γέρου τὰ μαρτύρια"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "87", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὴν πολλὴν ἀδυναμιὰν, τοῦ πόθου τὰ μυστήρια;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "88", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "δὲν δύνεται ʼς τὸ φυσικὸν, μόνον εἰς ταῖς λουλάδες, 85"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "89", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "φιλεῖ, τζιμπᾷ, μαλάσσει την, καὶ κάμνει μελανάδες."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "90", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπόν γροικήσετε καλὰ τὸ φυσικὸν τί θέλει"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "91", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κʼ ἡ νεότης πῶς ὀρέγεται νὰ τρῷ συχνὰ τὸ μέλι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "92", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔκλινεν κάτου τὴν κορφὴν κʼ ᾑ ῥίζαις ἀποβγῆκαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "93", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ πλέον οὐδὲν δύνεται ʼς τὴν κοσμικὴν τὴν γλύκαν. 90"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "94", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ στέργει ὁ κακότυχος μὲ πίκρα νὰ ζηλεύῃ."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "95", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "γροικῶντα πῶς δὲν δύνεται τὴν φύσιν νὰ δουλεύῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "96", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κάθε πουρνὸ σηκόνεται ἡ κόρη χολιασμέμη·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "97", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "σὰν νἄτρωγε ῥοδόμηλα, στέκει ἀπομουδιασμένη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "98", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀνάπλεκη, ἀνορδίνιαστη, κρέμονται τὰ μαλλιά της, 95"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "99", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ στέκει μὲ τὸν σκόντουφλον, ʼβρίζει τὴν φαμελιάν της,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "100", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼβρίσκει ἀφορμὴ καὶ λέγει της καὶ δέρνει τὴν κοπέλαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "101", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λέγει της „πῶς δὲν ἔπλενες, βρωμοῦσσα, τὰ σκουτέλα;“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "102", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐβγάνει τὸ καλήγι της καὶ ʼς τὴν κορφὴν κτυπᾷ την,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "103", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "„ἄγωμε, στρῶσε γλήγορα τὸ βρωμερὸν κρεββάτι.“ 100"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "104", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πάντα μουγκρίζει μοναχὴ καὶ μὲ τὸ σκούτοφλό ʼναι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "105", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὸ σπήτι ἂν ἔναι σπαστρικό, λέγει, „ἀσάρωτό ʼναι,“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "106", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "φωνάζει, „σύρε, φέρε μου, μωρὴ, γοργόν τὴν ῥόκα"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "107", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τʼ ἀλεξανδρινὸν σκουλὶν ἐκεῖνο τὸ σὲ δῶκα.“"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "108", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τρέχει κοπέλα, φέρνει το, κι ἂς λησμονᾷ τʼ ἀδράκτι, 105"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "109", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κρούει κλωτσιὰ, ʼγκρεμνίζει την κάτω ʼς τὸν καταῤῥάκτην."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "110", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὲ τὰ κατσιὰ δικάζεται, μαλόνει μὲ τʼ ἀρνίθια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "111", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τοῦτο δὲν λέγω ψέματα, νὰ λέγω παραμύθια."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "112", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ταύταις ὅλαις ταῖς χολαῖς, ὅλαις ταῖς φθαίγει ὁ γέρος."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "113", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὦ κύριε, ποῦ τʼ ἀνάγκασεν νὰ μὴ ἰδῇ τὸ θέρος, 110"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "114", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὦ κύριε, δεῖξε θάμασμα εἰς τοὺς προξενητάδες,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "115", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁπὤδοσαν τοῦ γέροντος τὴν νεὰν διὰ ταῖς ἰντράδες·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "116", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅποιος θυμήθη πρωταρχῆς τούτην τὴν ὑπανδρείαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "117", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ποῦ νὰ τὰ φᾶν τὰ κρειάτα του ἀρκοῦδες καὶ θηρία."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "118", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τίς τὸν ἐπροξένησε ποῦ νᾆχε φᾶ φαρμάκι, 115"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "119", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁπὤσμιξε τὸν κόρακα μετὰ τὸ τρυγονάκι;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "120", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τίς ἦτον ʼπῶ προξένησε τὸ βρωμερὸ τὸ σκόρδο"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "121", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὲ τʼ ἄσπρον τὸ τριαντάφυλλον καὶ μυρωδάτον ῥόδον;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "122", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τίς ἦτον ʼποῦ τὴν ἔσμιξε τὴν ἀγριοτζουκνίδα"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "123", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μʼ αὐτήνην τὴν ῥοδόμνοστην καὶ γλυκοκορασίδα; 120"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "124", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ κάψῃ ὁ θεὸς τὰ ῥοῦχά του καὶ τὰ φλωριά του ὁμάδι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "125", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ τὸν κάψῃ καὶ κακὸν θανάτου ἀμπελοκλάδι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "126", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τότε γουργὰ νὰ τὤκουσα, ἀτός μου νὰ τὸ εἶδα"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "127", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τὸν ἐπάρῃ ὁ δαίμονας ʼς τὸν ᾅδην διὰ μερίδα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "128", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διατί ἔπρεπʼ ὁ κακότυχος καλόγερος νὰ γένῃ, 125"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "129", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ ξεδουλεύῃ τὴν ψυχὴν πολὺ μαγαρισμένη·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "130", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔπρεπέ τον νὰ φόρεσε μαντὶ καὶ καμηλαύκι"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "131", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ῥάσινον ʼποκάμισον, διὰ τὴν ψυχὴν νὰ πάσχῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "132", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ φᾷ τὸ πρικοφάρμακον ἀντάμα μὲ τὸν πόνον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "133", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διατί ἔφθειρε τῆς κορασιᾶς τὸν ζαχαράτον κλῶνον, 130"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "134", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τοῦ πόθου ταῖς ξεφάντωσες, τῆς νεότης ταῖς τρομάραις"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "135", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔφαγεν ὁ ἀχρόνιστος δίχως χαραῖς κι ἀντάραις."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "136", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐτοῦ μὲ σφάζει τὸ λοιπὸν καὶ συμπονῶ καὶ κλαίγω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "137", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "θυμούμενος συχνοτρομῶ καὶ ὅλος μέσα τρέμω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "138", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπὸν τὸ δίκαιον κάμνει με νὰ λέγω καὶ νὰ γράψω 135"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "139", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ τὸ ʼπῶ ὅλο φανερὰ καὶ νὰ μηδὲν τὸ πάψω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "140", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τί σὲ ʼφελᾷ, βεργόλυγη, νἄχης τὸν γέρον ἄνδρα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "141", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τὸν θωρῇς ὁλόψαρον σὰν τράγον εἰς τὴν μάνδρα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "142", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ στάζῃ ἡ μύξα του συχνὰ ὡσὰν τῆς προβατίνας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "143", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ ʼξγομπιάζῃ ἡ ῥάχη του σὰν τὸν λαιμὸν τῆς χήνας, 140"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "144", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τὸν γροικᾷς ὁληνυκτὶς νὰ βήχῃ σὰν τὴν αἶγαν;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "145", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἄδικον ποὖτον εἰς ἐσέ, κρίμα πολὺ καὶ μέγαν·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "146", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀτή σου κρῖνε τὸ λοιπὸν τοῦτο τὸ καταλόγιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "147", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἂν καί ʼπρεπε ῥοδόμνοστης τέτοιον γεροντολόγιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "148", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰς τέτοιον ἀπάνθρωπον καὶ τέτοιαν συχασία! 145"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "149", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἄδικον ποὖτον εἰς ἐσὲν καὶ ἀδικοκρισία"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "150", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼς τέτοια κάλλη σὰν αὐτὰ καὶ τόσαις εὐμορφάδες,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "151", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁπὤχει τὸ κορμάκι σου, μὲ τόσαις ἐγλυκάδες."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "152", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἄφες τον τὸν συχαντερὸν εἰς τὴν κακήν του ὥραν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "153", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ποῦ νἄβγαλεν εἰς τὸ κορμὶ τὸ γρόσιμαν καὶ ψώραν, 150"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "154", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔπαρε ἕναν νεούτσικον ἔτσι ὡσὰν ἐσένα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "155", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ σφικτοαγκαλιάζεσθε καὶ νᾆστʼ ἀγαπημένα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "156", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ γροικᾷ ἡ καρδίτσα σας τοῦ πόθου τὴν ἀγάπην·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "157", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διατί οἱ νέοι ἂς χαίρωνται κι ὁποῦ γροικάει ἂς βλέπῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "158", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ στάζῃ ζαχαρόδροσον σὰν τὤμορφον σταφύλι, 155"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "159", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ πιπιλίζῃ ἕνας τἀλλοῦ τὸ στόμα καὶ τὰ χείλη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "160", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼς τὴν κοσμικὴν ἐπιθυμιὰν νᾆστεν συχνὰ δοσμένοι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "161", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼς τοῦ πόθου τὴν γλυκότητα πάντοτʼ ἀγκαλιασμένοι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "162", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὰ μέλη σου νὰ γαργαλοῦν, νὰ δράμῃς καὶ νὰ πιάσῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "163", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ δροσιστῇ ἡ καρδοῦλά σου, ὅλη νʼ ἀγαλλιάσῃ, 160"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "164", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ ῥᾳθυμᾷς ἐκ τὴν χαρὰν καὶ νὰ μηδὲν χορταίνῃς,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "165", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κʼ ἐκ τῆς χαρᾶς γλυκώτατην τὴν χάριν νὰ λαμβάνῃς."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "166", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τοῦ νεούτσικου τὸ φίλημα καὶ τʼ ἀγκαλιάσματά του"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "167", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ʼμοιάζουν ʼς τʼ Ἀπρίλη ταῖς δροσιαῖς, τʼ ἄνθη καὶ τὰ καλά του."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "168", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μυρίζουσιν τὰ χνῶτά του ώς κιτρολεμωνίτσι, 165"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "169", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὸ κορμὶ τὸ ἔμορφον ὡς δροσερὸ ἀγκουρίτσιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "170", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐκεῖνο ὁποῦ ὀρέγεστεν καλὰ καὶ ἀγαπᾶτε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "171", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τί νὰ σᾶς λέγω τὰ πολλά; ἂν μὲ καλὰ γροικᾶτε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "172", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "περιττοπλεὸν τοὺς ἄνδρες σας, διατί τούς ἀγαπᾶτε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "173", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κάμε νὰ τοὺς διαλέγετε, νὰ μὴν μετανογᾶτε, 170"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "174", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μόνον διὰ τὸ γλυκώτατον τοῦ πόθου τὸ βοτάνι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "175", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁπὦναι πρὸς τὴν ἐρωτιὰν παρέτοιμον, καὶ πιάνει·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "176", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πρέπει λοιπὸν ἡ καθεμιὰ διὰ νὰ καλοδιαλέγῃ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "177", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διατί πολλαῖς καὶ βλαστημοῦν τὴν μοῖράν ταις καὶ κλαίγουν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "178", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν ὥρα ὅπου γεννήθησαν πάντα τους ἀτιμάζουν, 175"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "179", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀναστενάζουν, θλίβονται, μέσα τους πάντα ʼβρίζουν."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "180", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔπρεπε νὰ τὴν κλαίγουσιν ὡσὰν ἀποθαμένη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "181", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ τὴν λυπᾶται ὁ καθεεὶς τὴν κακοπανδρεμένη."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "182", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπόν παρακαλῶ σάς το, κάμετε νὰ φρονῆτε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "183", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μὴν πλανεθῆτε σὲ φλωριὰ, τὴν νειότην νὰ πουλῆτε, 180"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "184", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ἂν ἦτον ʼμπορεσάμενον ἡ νειότης νὰ πουλιέται,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "185", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "στέργω, κανένας γέροντας ʼς τὸν κόσμον νὰ μὴν ἦτον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "186", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "στέργω, τὸν βιόν του ἔδιδεν, νὰ * μνήσῃ μὲ τὸ ἱμάτι,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "187", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "μόνον νὰ ἐξανάνειονε τὸ παλαιὸν δερματάκι."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "188", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "λοιπὸν καὶ σεῖς τὴν νειότην σας χαίρεστεν ὥστε ζῆτε, 185"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "189", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ʼβρέτε νέους σὰν ἐσεῖς, καλὰ συντροφευτῆτε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "190", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ κεῖνος ʼποῦ σᾶς ἔπλασεν ἔχει τὴν μέριμνά σας"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "191", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ σᾶς χορτάσῃ τἀγαθά, βλέποντας τὰ καλά σας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "192", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ἡ χάρις τοῦ θεοῦ σᾶς θέλει θεραπεύσει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "193", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πᾶσα καλὸ ʼς τὸ σπήτιν σας νὰ ʼδῇς νὰ περισσεύσῃ. 190"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "194", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅσοι τʼ ἀκούγωσιν καλὰ, θέλουσιν κάμει κάλλια"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "195", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ βλέπουν νὰ προσέχωνται τοῦ γέροντος τὰ σάλια,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "196", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ μὴν ζυγόνουσιν πολλὰ ʼς τοῦ γέροντος τὸ βρῶμα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "197", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ὅλος ὁ κακότυχος ἔναι κοπριὰ καὶ χῶμα·"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "198", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὅταν ἔλθῃ νὰ γενῇ χρονῶν ἑβδομηντάρης, 195"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "199", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "χάνει τὸν νοῦν, τὸν λογισμόν, γίνεται δαιμονιάρης,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "200", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ὅσον γεροῦν οἱ γέροντες, ὅσον καιρὸς διαβαίνει,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.peri_gerontos", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "201", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 3.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τόσον ἐκ τὸ κεφάλιν τους ὁ μυαλὸς φυραίνει."}
